{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-littala-aalto-and-kanto-candles-2512-0272","content_id":"5a73aadc-f2f1-48dd-b664-0a9802916c63","description":"Product Recall for Littala Aalto and Kanto Candles presenting a serious risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"a33f0db3-a333-45ec-9159-ce1964103629","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-01-05T10:13:42+00:00","id":"a33f0db3-a333-45ec-9159-ce1964103629","title":"Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-01-05T10:13:42+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695b8ed6295a95414df21acd/2512-0272-product-recall-littala-alto-and-kanto-candle.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Littala Aalto and Kanto Candles</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of fire as testing indicates the wick may ‘club’, resulting in higher-than-expected flaming.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action:  The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Decorative Articles - Candles</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Littala</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>Aalto and Kanto</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Denmark</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Pillar candles in a range of colours and sizes.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_a33f0db3-a333-45ec-9159-ce1964103629\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695b8ed6295a95414df21acd/2512-0272-product-recall-littala-alto-and-kanto-candle.pdf\">Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"affected-products\">Affected Products</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Code</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Barcode</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Name</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1077954</td>\n      <td>6411923685115</td>\n      <td>Kanto block candle 10cm sand</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1077955</td>\n      <td>6411923685122</td>\n      <td>Kanto block candle 10cm ash</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1077956</td>\n      <td>6411923685139</td>\n      <td>Kanto block candle 10cm fire</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1077957</td>\n      <td>6411923685146</td>\n      <td>Kanto block candle 16cm sand</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1077958</td>\n      <td>6411923685153</td>\n      <td>Kanto block candle 16cm ash</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1077959</td>\n      <td>6411923685160</td>\n      <td>Kanto block candle 16cm fire</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1082887</td>\n      <td>6411923688185</td>\n      <td>Aalto block candle 8cm fire</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1082888</td>\n      <td>6411923688192</td>\n      <td>Aalto block candle 8cm water</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1082889</td>\n      <td>6411923688208</td>\n      <td>Aalto block candle 8cm sand</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1082881</td>\n      <td>6411923688123</td>\n      <td>Aalto block candle 16cm fire</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1082882</td>\n      <td>6411923688130</td>\n      <td>Aalto block candle 16cm water</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1082883</td>\n      <td>6411923688147</td>\n      <td>Aalto block candle 16cm sand</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1082884</td>\n      <td>6411923688154</td>\n      <td>Aalto block candle 11cm fire</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1082885</td>\n      <td>6411923688161</td>\n      <td>Aalto block candle 11cm water</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1082886</td>\n      <td>6411923688178</td>\n      <td>Aalto block candle 11cm sand</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of fire as testing indicates that the wick may ‘club,’ resulting in higher-than-expected flaming. This could lead to increased smoking, wax dripping, and flaming. If left unattended, the flare could ignite nearby objects and potentially cause a fire to spread throughout the room.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulation 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product is being recalled from end users. We recommend that consumers stop using the product immediately and return it to their place of purchase for a refund. No receipt is required. Please see: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.iittala.com/en-gb/footer/recall\">Littala Recall</a> for more information.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2512-0272</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-24T12:46:58Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"affected-products","level":3,"text":"Affected Products"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"household-decorative-articles","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-24","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-24T12:46:58+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-reca